values (
  $t$mythe-zamba-evu-beti$t$,
  $t$Zamba, Mingon et l'evu : pourquoi Dieu s'en est allé$t$,
  $t$Zamba, Mingon and the evu: why God went away$t$,
  $t$Mythe beti (Ewondo, Eton, Bënë, Evuzok et leurs cousins bulu, ntumu et fang), région du Centre, Cameroun.$t$,
  $t$A Beti myth (Ewondo, Eton, Bënë, Evuzok and their Bulu, Ntumu and Fang cousins), Centre region, Cameroon.$t$,
